      "content": "thanks, that's a relief to hear. i was getting really stressed about it. i actually had a bit of a pounding headache earlier today after lunch, but it went away pretty fast so i figured it was just from the diet changes. since you're saying small amounts are fine, do you think i should just keep going as planned or is there like a specific dose or something i should look out for to make sure i'm not overdoing the tyramine?",
